  <h1 class="display">OUR MISSION</h1>
  <div class="mission__grid">
    <img src="{{ '2ddd8d_3301f5b3b58740a4ab740a91e21ca1d3' | img }}" {{ '2ddd8d_3301f5b3b58740a4ab740a91e21ca1d3' | imgSize | safe }} alt="Students working on laptops in a classroom">
    <div class="mission__text">
      <p>Envision Education is an initiative designed to support digital learning and expand access to knowledge in remote areas. Our mission is to provide students with access to global resources that improve their skills and future opportunities. This work begins with supplying laptops and iPads to schools and students, connecting them to a wealth of global resources.</p>
      <p>As we embrace digitalization, students in remote regions gain a global perspective, acquire real-world skills, and learn how to leverage technology for expanded future prospects. Ultimately, we aim to empower these students to take charge of their own learning, engage with global issues, and experience comprehensive digital exposure, inspiring them to dream bigger with the world at their fingertips.</p>
      <p>Envision has partnered with several organizations to support our mission. FedEx assists with laptop collection and international shipping, Fairfield by Marriott supports our work in Nepal through accommodations, and the VG Foundation serves as a key local partner by coordinating with schools and communities. These partnerships are essential to the success of our initiative and help ensure lasting impact in the classrooms we serve.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
